{"url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/", "text": "S.B.Deorah College\nUGC Public Self Disclosure\n|\nReach Us\nRTI\nLibrary Membership Form\nS B DEORAH COLLEGE, ULUBARI\n(Accredited by NAAC and NIRF listed)\nAISHE ID: C-17177\nSTUDENT'S CORNER\nNIRF\nDescription\nNIRF Report\nACTIVITIES\nCELLS\nDOWNLOADS\nChronicler\nProspectus\nClass Routine\nExam Routine\nAcademic Calendar\nGU Syllabus\nForms\nDIGITAL LIBRARY\nPHOTO GALLERY\nCONTACT US\nHOME\nABOUT US\nHistory\nVision, Mission & Objectives\nEmblem Description\nCollege Anthem\nADMINISTRATION\nPrincipal's Profile\nGoverning Body\nAdministrative Staff\nTeaching Staff\nCode of Conduct\nCommittees\nOrganogram\nPolicy Documents\nRTI\nAnnual Report\nPerspective Plan\nInstitutional Development Plan\nACADEMICS\nDepartments\nArts\nCommerce\nScience\nStudy Center\nKKHSOU\nGUCODE\nPrograms of Study\nAdd on and Certificate Courses\nCourses and Programmes Outcomes\nMoU with Other Institutions\nNAAC\nAQAR\nIIQA\nSSR\nDVV\nSSR DVV Clarification\nAccreditation Outcome\nIQAC\nObjectives\nCo-ordinator's Profile\nMembers\nMinutes of the Meetings\nActivities\nBest Practice\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nFeedback and Action Taken Report\nFeedback Analysis\nAnnexure\nLIBRARY\nFACILITIES\nARCHIVE\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nInstagram\nWelcome to S.B.Deorah College ||\nThe listed students should login in the Samarth portal and 'accept' our 'offer' of admission.\nNews & Notice\nTenders\nLateral Entry Notification (2)\nClick Here\nLateral Entry General Information\nClick Here\nStudent Induction Programme\nClick Here\nLateral Entry Notification\nClick Here\nFinal Spot Admission (Revised Dates)\nClick Here\nGuideline for spot admission\nClick Here\nMerit List 2 (BBA)\nClick Here\nMerit List 2 (Arts)\nClick Here\nMerit List 2 (Commerce)\nClick Here\nMerit List 2 (Science)\nClick Here\nRead More\nQuotation inviting supply of Goods/Materials/Items\nClick Here\nRead More\nPrevious\nNext\nWelcome to\nSreenivas Basudev Deorah College, popularly referred to as S. B. Deorah College, nestles in an ideal location in the arterial G. S. Road of Guwahati. Formerly named, Ulubari College, this institution started functioning in the premises of the neighbouring Ulubari High School in the evening on 9th September 1984 with 75 students in its roll for the higher secondary programme.\nThe College has been set up with the painstaking efforts of a few academically conscious personalities who felt the need of an institution of higher education in the Ulubari locality. Late Chidananda Das, former Registrar of Gauhati University, was the founder President of the Steering Committee of the College. On 9th September 1987, the college started functioning from its own temporary Assam-type shed. It was upgraded to the status of Degree College in the same year.\nRead More\nPrincipal\nDr. Dharmendra Nath, M.A., LL.B., Ph.D\nS.B. Deorah College, established in 1984 under the pioneering leadership of some visionaries of Ulubari area of Guwahati is a prominent seat of higher learning in the North East. Here, we strive to impart quality education to the learners who come from various parts of the region. We also try to imbibe the core values of life to the students so that they become good human beings and good citizens. Affiliated to Gauhati University, we have been providing conventional Arts, Science and Commerce education in all these years. One of our priority areas is development of skills among the students and we have been offering some vocational and job-oriented Certificate and Add-on courses.\nRead More\nCourse and Programme Outcomes\nInternal Assessment Grievance Form\nGrievance Redressal Cell Form\nAcademic Bank of Credits (ABC)\nAnti Ragging Guideline\nProfessional Ethics and Code of Conduct\nAwards and\nAchievements\nView All\nSELECTION OF NSS VOLUNTEERS FOR PARTICIP\n2022-05-22\nLETTER OF APPRECIATION FROM THE PRESIDEN\n2022-06-18\nTWO STAR CERTIFICATE TO IIC, S B DEORAH\n2022-11-17\nS B DEORAH COLLEGE WAS SELECTED AS ONE O\n2022-12-01\nS B DEORAH COLLEGE WAS SELECTED AS ONE O\n2022-12-01\nNSS STATE AWARD 2021-22: DR. RUMAMANI DE\n2024-01-26\nNSS STATE AWARD 2021-22\r\n\r\nMEHFUZ ALI, A\n2024-01-26\nLETTER OF APPRECIATION RECEIVED FROM MIN\n2024-06-02\nCollege Gallery\nPhotos\nVideos\nView Images\nInfrastructural Facilities\nCollege Campus\nView Videos\nCollege\nAnthem\nCollege\nStatistics\n1500+\nStudents\n75+\nTeachers & Staffs\n15+\nDepartments\n75+\nCourses\nCollege Links\nOnline Portal\nStaff Login\nStudent Login\nTeaching-Learning\nOur Departments\nAssamese\nBotany\nChemistry\nCommerce\nComputer Science\nEconomics\nEducation\nEnglish\nHistory\nMathematics\nPhilosophy\nPhysics\nPolitical Science\nStatistics\nZoology\nImportant Links\nUGC\nGauhati University\nAICTE\nIGNOU\nSAMARTH\nDHE, Assam\nNAAC\nRUSA\nKKHSOU\nContact Us\nS.B.Deorah College\nG.S Road, Ulubari,\nGuwahati, Assam 781007,\nIndia\n[email protected]\n0361-2523172\nTerms and Conditions\nQuick Links\nonline portal\nAbout College\nAlumni Registration\nMission,Vision and Objectives\nLibrary\nRTI Act\nTeaching Staff\nCopyright © 2026 S.B. Deorah College\nPowered By S.S. Technologies", "links": [{"label": "UGC Public Self Disclosure", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/ugc_psd.php"}, {"label": "Reach Us", "url": "https://maps.app.goo.gl/CsRwY223LMJYj6g6A"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/"}, {"label": "RTI", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/rti.php"}, {"label": "Library Membership Form", "url": "https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScCyfqUAUVvDQZY3ABWRLdk3LgIsNR-_ZrrIc-5MDYaQRuoZw/viewform"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/index.php"}, {"label": "STUDENT'S CORNER", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/studentcorner.php"}, {"label": "Description", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.in/nirfdescription.php"}, {"label": "NIRF Report", "url": "https://sbdeorahcollege.org.